<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="RUT" style="id">- Ngoni Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Lutu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Chitabu cha Lutu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Lutu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Lutu</para>
  <para style="mt2">Chitabu cha</para>
  <para style="mt1">Lutu</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongolelu</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Lutu chikokosa mambu ga kukangasa, gegavakolili vandu va munyumba yimonga ya Izilaeli mu lukumbi lwa vahamula va Izilaeli. Naomi mweavili mau wa vandu va munyumba yeniyi, gakumkolela malilu gavaha, lukumbi mngana waki na vana vavi vavili va chigosi vevafwili pevavi ku uyehe ku mulima wa Moabu. Pagenago, Naomi amotiswi lukumbi Lutu mweavili mmonga wa vakamwana vaki, mweavi mkolonjinji wa ku mulima wa Moabu kuhamula mwene kulandana nayu na kumtangatila. Naomi ilandana na Lutu mu lugendu lwaki lwa kuwuya ku mulima waki wa Izilaeli. Pagenago, voha vavili, Lutu na Naomi vimotiswa, pala Boazi, mmonga wa valongo va papipi va munyumba ya Naomi, peahamwili kuvayunga na kuyidakila kumgega Lutu. Lukumbi lwa vahamula lwavi lukumbi lwangaganikiwa, ndava Vaizilaeli vamahele vatamayi changali kulanda mihilu. Nambu Naomi na Lutu pamonga na Boazi vavi luhumu lwabwina kwa Vaizilaeli vevatamili kwa kulanda na kuyidakila mihilu ya Bambu Chapanga.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kawaka mundu yeyoha mweamumanyili mundu mweayandiki chitabu cha Lutu. Mewa ligono levayandiki chitabu chenichi limanyikini lepi, nambu vandu vamahele viholalela kuvya chitabu chenichi chayandikwi lukumbi Vaizilaeli pevawuyili kuhuma ku mahamilu, kulandana na Chiebulania chechihengiki mu kuyandika chitabu chenichi. Lijabu labwina neju ndi kuvya nkosi Daudi avili mjukulu wa Lutu. Lutu avili lepi Muizilaeli. Mana yaki ndi kuvya mdala mwenuyo ayingili pagati ya vagogo va lukolo lwa Yese. Lijambu lenili likokosa uchakaka kuvya Bambu Chapanga ihagula lepi kuwanangana na vandu va munyumba, nambu ihagula kulandana na mtima wa mundu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gegavili mugati</para>
  <para style="io1">Sula ya 1 yikokosa mambu ga vandu va munyumba ya Naomi na malilu gavaha gegavakolili na Naomi na Lutu chevawuyili ku Izilaeli.</para>
  <para style="io1">Sula ya 2 yikokosa Lutu cheakonganiki na Boazi, peayimamila mahengu ga kubena mabenu mu mgunda waki, Lutu peanongayi mazanga ga mabenu, pala vabenaji pevamalili kuyola mabenu.</para>
  <para style="io1">Sula ya 3 yikokosa Naomi cheamulagizi Lutu kumgana Boazi amgega na kumuyunga, ndava avili mlongo waki wa papipi ndava ya kugegana. Boazi ayidakili kutimilisa lijambu lenilo.</para>
  <para style="io1">Sula ya 4 yikokosa Boazi cheagombwili mgunda wewavi wa mngana wa Naomi mweafwili. Kangi Boazi akamgega Lutu.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="RUT 1" />
  <para style="s">Elimeleki na vandu va munyumba yaki vihamalila ku Moabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 1:1" />Penapo kadeni, Vaamula pevatalalilayi pa Izilaeli, yahumalili njala pamulima wenuwo. Mundu mmonga kuhuma ku Betelehemu ya ku Yuda pamonga na mdala waki na vana vavi va chigosi vavili vahambili kutama kwa lukumbi ku mulima wa Moabu ngati vayehe. <verse eid="RUT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 1:2" />Mundu mwenuyo liina laki Elimeleki na mdala waki akemiwa Naomi. Maina ga vana vavi va chigosi, mmonga akemiwi Mahaloni na yungi Kilioni. Mundu mwenuyo pamonga na valongo vaki vavi va lukolo lwa Efulati, kuhuma ku muji wa Betelehemu, mu mulima wa Yuda. Vakahamba ku Moabu, na vakatama kwenuko. <verse eid="RUT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 1:3" />Elimeleki mngana wa Naomi afwili, Naomi asigalili na vana vaki vavili vagosi vala. <verse eid="RUT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 1:4" />Vasongolo venavo vakavagega vasikana Vamoabu. Vaadala venavo mmonga akemiwi Olipa na yungi akemiwa Lutu. Pevatamili kwenuko kwa miyaka kumi, <verse eid="RUT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 1:5" />Maloni na Kilioni vafwili. Hinu Naomi asigalili mwene, changali mngana wala vana vaki vagosi vavili vala.<verse eid="RUT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Naomi na Lutu viwuya ku Betelehemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 1:6" />Naomi peayuwini kuvya Bambu Chapanga avamotisi vandu vaki kwa kuvapela chakulya, hinu mwene pamonga na vakamwana vaki vajitendekili kuwuka kwenuko, kuwuya ku Izilaeli. <verse eid="RUT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 1:7" />Ndi Naomi pamonga na vakamwana vaki vakawuka pandu pala pevatamayi, vakatumbula kuwuya ku mulima wa Yuda. <verse eid="RUT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 1:8" />Hinu Naomi akavajovela vakamwana vaki vavili vala, “Muwuya kila mmonga kunyumba ya nyina waki. Bambu Chapanga avahengela gabwina ngati nyenye chemwanihengili gabwina nene pamonga na vangana vinu vala vevafwili. <verse eid="RUT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 1:9" />Bambu Chapanga avatangatila, kila mmonga winu apata pandu pa kutama cha uteke kwa mngana waki.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 1:9">Ndi Naomi akavalaga na kuvakumbatila cha uganu ngati chewavili mvelu wavi. Nambu vene vakatumbuala kuvemba kwa lwami, <verse eid="RUT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 1:10" />na kumjovela, “Lepi! Tigana kuhamba pamonga na veve kwa vandu vaku.”<verse eid="RUT 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 1:11" />Nambu Naomi akavajovela vakamwana vaki, “Chondi, muwuya mwavakamwana vangu. Ndava kyani munilandayi nene? Wu, muhololela kuvya nihotola kupata kavili vana vagosi vevakuvagega nyenye? <verse eid="RUT 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 1:12" />Muwuya kunyumba yinu mwavakamwana vangu, ndava muni nene namgogolo neju, nihotola lepi kugegewa kavili. Hati ngati nganiholalela kuvya nihotola kupata vana, na hati ngati nikagonekana na mgosi kilu yeniyi, na kuveleka vana vagosi, <verse eid="RUT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 1:13" />wu, ngamuhotwili kulindila mbaka vakulayi? Wu, ngamuhotwili kujidivalila mukotoka kugegewa na vagosi vangi? Lepi, vakamwana vangu! Nene nina mvinisu neju kuliku nyenye, muni Bambu Chapanga anibunili.”<verse eid="RUT 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 1:14" />Penapo vakavemba kavili kwa lwami. Ndi Olipa akamkumbatila cha uganu nanyala waki, akamlaga na kuwuya kunyumba, nambu Lutu abelili kulekana nayu. <verse eid="RUT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 1:15" />Hinu Naomi akamjovela, “Lutu, lola mlumbu waku iwuya kwa vandu vaki na kwa michapanga yaki, hinu na veve uwuya pamonga nayu.”<verse eid="RUT 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 1:16" />Nambu Lutu akamuyangula, “Kotoka kunikulukisa nikuleka amala nikotoka kukulanda. Kwokwoha kwewihamba na nene yati nihamba, na kwewitama veve na nene yati nitama. Vandu vaku, yati vivya vandu vangu, na Chapanga waku, yati ivya Chapanga wangu. <verse eid="RUT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 1:17" />Pandu peufwilila veve na nene yati nifwilila penapo, na yati nizikwa bahopo. Bambu Chapanga anibunayi neju, ngati yati nilekana na veve, nambu kwa lifwa ndu.”<verse eid="RUT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 1:18" />Naomi peamanyili kuvya Lutu ahamwili kuhamba pamonga nayu, akaleka kumkulukisa kavili.<verse eid="RUT 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 1:19" />Ndi voha vavili vakayendelela na lugendu, na vakahika ku Betelehemu. Pevahikili kwenuko, vandu voha vakakangasa, na vadala vakakotana, “Wu, mwenuyu ndi Naomi?”<verse eid="RUT 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 1:20" />Naomi akajova, “Mkotoka kunikemela kavili Naomi, munikemela Mala, ndava muni Bambu Chapanga mweavi na makakala goha, akitili wumi wangu uvya na mvinisu neju. <verse eid="RUT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 1:21" />Penawukili penapa, navii na vindu vyamahele, nambu hinu Bambu Chapanga aniwuyisi changali chindu. Ndava kyani mukunikemela Naomi kuni Bambu Chapanga anibunili na aning'aili.”<verse eid="RUT 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 1:22" />Chenicho ndi Naomi pamonga na Lutu Mmoabu, mkamwana waki, chevawuyili kuhuma ku Moabu, na kuhika ku Betelehemu lukumbi lwa kubena shayili palwatumbula.<verse eid="RUT 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="RUT 2" />
  <para style="s">Lutu ihenga lihengu ku mgunda wa Boazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 2:1" />Naomi avii na mlongo waki wa lukolo lwa Elimeleki mngana waki, mweakemiwi Boazi. Mundu mwenuyo avili na vindu vyamahele na mweatopiswi neju ndava ya matendu gaki gabwina. <verse eid="RUT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 2:2" />Ligono limonga, Lutu mundu wa kuhuma ku Moabu amjovili Naomi, “Uniyidakila nihamba ku mgunda kunonga masigalilu ga mabenu mumbele ya mbenaji yoyoha mweakuniyidakilila.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 2:2">Naomi akamjovela, “Ena mkamwana wangu, hambayi.”<verse eid="RUT 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 2:3" />Hinu Lutu akahamba ku mgunda, akavalanda vabenaji kuni inonga mazanga gevagalekelili. Kumbi mgunda weanongayi wavi wa Boazi, wa lukolo lwa Elimeleki, mngana wa Naomi.<verse eid="RUT 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 2:4" />Bahopo Boazi abwelili kuhuma ku Betelehemu, akavajambusa vabenaji, akajova, “Bambu Chapanga avyai pamonga na nyenye.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 2:4">Vene vakamuyangula, “Bambu Chapanga akumotisa.”<verse eid="RUT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 2:5" />Kangi Boazi amkotili yula mweavayimalila vabenaji, “Wu, mdala yula ndi wa yani?”<verse eid="RUT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 2:6" />Mweayimalila lihengu yula akamuyangula, “Yula ndi Mmoabu mweawuyili pamonga na Naomi kuhuma ku mulima wa Moabu. <verse eid="RUT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 2:7" />Mwene ayupili, ajovili, ‘Chondi uniyidakila nivalanda mumbele vabenaji, ninonga mazanga ga mabenu.’ Tangiya peabwelili lukela, inonga mabenu mu mgunda lukumbi lwoha, na apumulili kwa lukumbi luhupi ndu pa chikonjo.”<verse eid="RUT 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 2:8" />Kangi Boazi akamjovela Lutu, “Niyuwanila msikana wangu. Kotoka kuhamba kunonga mazanga ku mgunda wungi, na ukotoka kuwuka penapa. Ulandana pamonga na vahengaji vangu va chidala. <verse eid="RUT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 2:9" />Lola pandu pevibena vasongolo venava, nongayi mumbele ya vahengaji vadala. Nivabesili vasongolo ava vakotoka kukung'aha. Ngati uvii na njota, uhamba kuvihulu na unywai manji gevanegili vasongolo venavo.”<verse eid="RUT 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 2:10" />Penapo Lutu akafugama na kumgundamila Boazi mbaka pahi cha kumtopesa, akamkota, “Ndava kyani niyidakiliwi palongolo yaku, hati ukanikitila ubwina nene mwenivi muyehe?”<verse eid="RUT 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 2:11" />Nambu Boazi akamuyangula, “Nigayuwini gala goha geumuhengili nayala waku kutumbula peafwili mngana waku. Nimanyili chila cheuvalekili dadi na nyina waku pamonga na mulima waku, ubwelili kutama pamonga na vandu wangavamanya kutumbula kadeni. <verse eid="RUT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 2:12" />Bambu Chapanga akupela njombi ndava ya genago geukitili. Nikumuyupa Bambu Chapanga wa Izilaeli mweumuyupili akuyunga kwa makakala gaki, akupela njombi neju.”<verse eid="RUT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 2:13" />Lutu akamuyangula, “Mkulu wangu, unihengili gabwina, ulongili na nene bwina na kuupolesa mtima wangu, pamonga kuvya nene nammonga lepi wa vahengaji vaku va chidala.”<verse eid="RUT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 2:14" />Lukumbi lwa kulya chakulya, Boazi akamkamkela Lutu na kumjovela, “Bwela apa ujwiga libumunda mu divayi, ulyayi.” Hinu Lutu akatama pamonga na vabenaji, na Boazi akampela mabenu gegakalingwi, akalya na kuyukuta mbaka gangi akagaleka. <verse eid="RUT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 2:15" />Lutu peayendelelayi kunonga mazanga, Boazi akavalagiza vahengaji vaki, “Hati ngati akanonga mu malundiku, mkotoka kumng'aha. <verse eid="RUT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 2:16" />Nambu muhuta masasa kuhuma mu malundiku, mumleka anonga changali kumbesa.”<verse eid="RUT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 2:17" />Hinu Lutu ayendalili kunonga mazanga mbaka kimii, na peabulili shayili yila, apatili lidebe limonga na chidogo. <verse eid="RUT 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 2:18" />Kangi akagega mabenu gala mbaka ku bomani na kumlangisa nayalani waki chila cheanongili. Mewa awusili na kumpela Naomi chakulya chila chechasigalili chealyayi ku mgunda. <verse eid="RUT 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 2:19" />Hinu nayala waki akamkota, “Lelu unongili kwoki goha aga? Wu wavili ku mgunda wa yani? Amotisiwa yula mweakutangatili.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 2:19">Penapo Lutu akamuyangula nayala waki kuvya anongili ku mgunda wa mundu mmonga liina laki Boazi.<verse eid="RUT 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 2:20" />Hinu Naomi akamjovela mkamwana waki, “Bambu Chapanga ammotisa Boazi! Chapanga itimilisa ahadi zaki kwa vevavi mumi na vevafwili.” Ndi akayendelela kujova, “Mundu mwenuyo ndi mlongo witu wa papipi, mmonga wa vala veviganikiwa kutigombola.”<verse eid="RUT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 2:21" />Kangi Lutu mundu wa ku Moabu akajova, “Ena, anijovili nivya pamonga na vahengaji vaki mbaka vamala kubena mabenu goha.”<verse eid="RUT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 2:22" />Naomi akamjovela Lutu, “Ena mkamwana wangu. Ndi chabwina kuhenga lihengu pamonga na vadala vangi ku mgunda wa Boazi, muni ukahamba ku mgunda wa mundu yungi vihotola kukulemasa.” <verse eid="RUT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="RUT 2:23" />Hinu Lutu akanonga mazanga papipi na vahengaji va chidala va Boazi, mbaka lukumbi lwa kubena nganu na shayili pelwamaliki. Lukumbi lwenulo lwoha atamayi na Naomi, nayalani waki.<verse eid="RUT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="RUT 3" />
  <para style="s">Naomi akumpela ushauli Lutu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 3:1" />Badayi Naomi akamjovela Lutu, mkamwana waki, “Yikunigana kukulondela mgosi muni uvya na nyumba yaku wamwene. <verse eid="RUT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 3:2" />Hinu mwenuyu Boazi, mwewahengili lihengu na vasikana vaki, wu, wa lukolo lwitu lepi? Hinu yuwanila, chimihi ichi yati ibula shayili pa luvanja lwa kubulila. <verse eid="RUT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 3:3" />Hinu samba, unyala mahuta geginungalila na uwala nyula zezikunyambisa, kangi uhamba pandu peibululia, nambu yangalila ukoto kumanyikana kwaki mbaka peimala kulya na kunywa. <verse eid="RUT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 3:4" />Mewa upamanyayi pandu peihamba kugona, akatitila muhambila chinunu gubukula shuka na ugona pa magendelu gaki. Mwene yati akukujovela cha kukita.”<verse eid="RUT 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 3:5" />Lutu akamuyangula, “Yati nikita goha geunijovili.”<verse eid="RUT 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 3:6" />Hinu Lutu akahamba pa luvanja lwa kubulila mabenu, akakita gala geajoviwi na nayala waki. <verse eid="RUT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 3:7" />Boazi peamalili kulya na kunywa, akasangaluka mu mtima. Hinu akahamba papipi na likinja la shayili, akagona. Lutu akahamba chinunu akagubukula shuka na kugona pa magendelu gaki. <verse eid="RUT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 3:8" />Ndi kilu ng'ong'ololo, Boazi akakenyemuswa na akang'anamuka, akamuwona mdala agonili mu magendelu gaki. <verse eid="RUT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 3:9" />Akakota, “Wayani veve?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 3:9">Akamuyangula, “Nene ndi Lutu, mtumisi waku. Uganikiwa unigegayi, ndava muni veve ndi mlongo wangu wa papipi mweuganikiwa kunigombola.”<verse eid="RUT 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 3:10" />Boazi akajova, “Bambu Chapanga akumotisa msikana wangu. Ulangisi uganu weuvi wa usadikika neju kuliku wewaulangisi pa kutumbula. Uvahambili lepi vasongolo vangangu amala vevavi na vindu vyamahele. <verse eid="RUT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 3:11" />Hinu msikana wangu, kotoka kuyogopa. Yati nikukitila chindu chochoa chewiyupa. Ndava muni muji woha pamonga na vandu vangu vakumanyili kuvya veve ndi wamdala mbwina. <verse eid="RUT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 3:12" />Ndi chakaka kuvya nene ndi mlongo wa papipi mweniganikiwa kukugombola, nambu avi mundu yungi mweiganikiwa kukugombola, mwenuyo ndi mlongo wa papipi neju kuliku nene. <verse eid="RUT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 3:13" />Hinu veve utama apa kilu yoha, na chilau lukela yati timanya ngati yati akukugombola amala lepi. Ngati akakugombolayi ndi chabwina. Akabelai kwa liina la Bambu Chapanga mweavi mumi, nene yati nikukugombola. Gona mbaka lukela.”<verse eid="RUT 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 3:14" />Hinu Lutu agonili balapala pa magendelu gaki mbaka lukela, nambu ayumwiki lukela neju muni akotoka kuwonekana, ndava muni Boazi aganili lepi mundu amanyayi kuvya Lutu avi pandu pa kubulila mabenu. <verse eid="RUT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 3:15" />Kangi Boazi akamjovela, “Tandika nyula yaku pahi.” Lutu akitili chenicho. Boazi akamsopela shayili dumula sita, akamgegesa, mwene akawuya ku bomani. <verse eid="RUT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 3:16" />Peahikili ku bomani, nayala waki akamkota, “Msikana wangu, yavii wuli kwenuko?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 3:16">Lutu akamdandaulila gala goha Boazi geamkitili.<verse eid="RUT 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 3:17" />Kangi akajova, “Kotoka kuwuya kwa nayala waku mawoko gawaka, hinu anipelili dumula sita zenizi za shayili.”<verse eid="RUT 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 3:18" />Naomi akajova, “Hinu mkamwana wangu guna nuu mbaka pewimanya gegihumalila. Ndava muni Boazi yati ilekela lepi penapo, nambu yati itimilisa goha lelu.”<verse eid="RUT 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="RUT 4" />
  <para style="s">Boazi akumgega Lutu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 4:1" />Lukumbi lwenulo Boazi akakwela, akahamba pandu pala pevikonganekela vandu, pa mlyangu uvaha wa muji, akatama. Ndi yula mlongo wa Elimeleki mweaganikiwa avya wa kutumbula kugombola, yula mweamuluwili Boazi, apitili papipi na pandu penapo. Hinu Boazi amkemili akajova, “Mlongo, bwela utama apa.” Mundu yula akabwela na kutama pahi. <verse eid="RUT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 4:2" />Kangi Boazi avakemili vagogo kumi va muji, akavayupa vene vatamayi penapo. Vakatama. <verse eid="RUT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 4:3" />Penapo Boazi akamjovela mlongo waki yula, “Hinu Naomi mweawuyili kuhuma ku Moabu kula, igana kugulisa mgunda wula wewavi wa mlongo witu Elimeleki. <verse eid="RUT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 4:4" />Hinu nene niwene mbanga nikumanyisa mambu aga. Hinu ngati ukuugana mgunda wula, ugombolayi palongolo ya vagogo vevatamili apa. Nambu ngati ukuugana lepi ujova, ndava muni fwasi ya kuugombola mgunda wenuwo utumbula veve na nene ndi nilanda.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 4:4">Mwene akajova, “Nene yati nikuugombola.”<verse eid="RUT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 4:5" />Boazi akajova, “Chabwina, nambu ukaugombola mgunda kuhuma kwa Naomi, ndi yati mewa ukumgombola Lutu Mmoabu, lipwela wa lukolo lwa yula mweafwili muni mgunda wenuo usigalila mu lukolo lwa mweafwili yula.”<verse eid="RUT 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 4:6" />Mundu yula wa papipi neju akamuyangula, “Ngati naa, nene yati nikuugombola lepi mgunda wenuwo, ndava muni yilolekana kuvya yati nikuuyagisa uhali wangu. Veve uugombolayi wamwene, muni nene nihotola lepi kuugombola.”<verse eid="RUT 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 4:7" />Magono gala ku Izilaeli ngati vandu vigana kugombola amala kugotolana chindu, kwavii na mvelu kwa mundu kuvika ulangisu kwa kuhula chilatu chaki na kumpela yungi. Kwa ulangisu wenuwo Vaizilaeli valangisi kuvya mambu gavikwi bwina.<verse eid="RUT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 4:8" />Hinu mundu yula mweaganikiwa kuugombola akamjovela Boazi, “Uugula wamwene.” Penapo mlongo mwenuyo akawula chilatu chaki, akampela Boazi. <verse eid="RUT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 4:9" />Kangi Boazi akavajovela vagogo na vandu voha vevavi penapo, “Nyenye lelu muyuwini na kulola kuvya nene nigulili kuhuma kwa Naomi vindu vyoha vyevyavili vya Elimeleki na vindu vyoha vya Kilioni na vindu vyoha vya Maloni. <verse eid="RUT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 4:10" />Mewa nimtolili Lutu, Mmobu lipwela wa Maloni avya mdala wangu, ndava ya kuyendeleza liina la mweafwili pamonga na vindu vyaki, muni liina la mweafwili likotoka kuyaga pagati ya lukolo lwavi na ukumbuso wa muji waki. Nyenye lelu ndi mwemuyuwana na kulola.”<verse eid="RUT 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 4:11" />Hinu vagogo vala vevavi pa mlyangu uvaha na vandu voha vakayangula, “Ena, tete tiyuwana na kulola. Bambu Chapanga amkita mdala mwenuyu mwaibwela kwaku avya ngati Laheli na Lea, vevaveliki vana vamahele na kuvya mulima wa Izilaeli. Veve uneng'enalayi mu lukolo lwa Efulati, na ulumbiwa ku Betelehemu. <verse eid="RUT 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 4:12" />Kwa njila ya vana veakukupela Bambu Chapanga kupitila mdala mwenuyu, vandu va munyumba yaku vavya ngati vandu va munyumba ya Pelesi, yula Tamali mweamuvelekili Yuda, mngana waki.”<verse eid="RUT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chiveleku cha Boazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 4:13" />Hinu Boazi akamtola Lutu, akavya mdala waki, na vene vakagonekana. Bambu Chapanga akammotisa Lutu, akavya na ndumbu, na akamveleka mwana mgosi. <verse eid="RUT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 4:14" />Hinu vadala va muji wenuwo vakamjovela Naomi, “Alumbiwa Bambu Chapanga, yula mweangakuleka lelu changali kuvya na mlongo mweavi wa papipi wa kukuyunga, mwene avya na ulumba uvaha pa Izilaeli. <verse eid="RUT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 4:15" />Mwana mwenuyu yati akukukita uvyayi na makakala gavili mu wumi waku na kukuyunga mu ugogolo waku. Ndava nayala waku yula mweakugana na mweavi wabwina neju kwaku kuliku vana va chigosi saba, ndi mweamuveliki.” <verse eid="RUT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 4:16" />Hinu Naomi amtolili mwana mwenuyo, akampagata na akavya akumlela.<verse eid="RUT 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 4:17" />Vadala vevavi va papipi yaki vakajova, “Naomi apatili mjukulu mgosi.” Mwana mwenuyo vakamkemela liina laki Obedi. Mwene ndi dadi wa Yese, mweavi dadi wa Daudi.<verse eid="RUT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 4:18" />Chenichi ndi chiveleku cha Pelesi. Pelesi amveliki Heziloni, <verse eid="RUT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 4:19" />Hezilono amveliki Lami, na Lami amveliki Aminadabu, <verse eid="RUT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 4:20" />na Aminadabu amveliki Nashoni, na Nashoni amveliki Solomoni, <verse eid="RUT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 4:21" />na Solomoniamveliki Boazi, na Boazi amveliki Obedi, <verse eid="RUT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 4:22" />na Obedi amveliki Yese na Yese amveliki Daudi.<verse eid="RUT 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 4" />
</usx>